      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most playful bag this week is undoubtedly the LV Time Bag. Crafted from a blend of Monogram canvas and cowhide leather, its standout feature is the acrylic clock face that reveals a Monogram flower embossed backdrop, Monogram canvas hour hands, and metallic rings marking the hours—a clever nod to the house's fall-winter 2026 men's show theme, 'Looking Back, Moving Forward.'",
      "url": null,
